    <!--
      Each <item> is one release. The release script appends a new <item>
      at the top of <channel> after a successful build:
        1. Notarize + staple the DMG
        2. Run `sign_update Blink.dmg` from the Sparkle SPM checkout's bin/
        3. Append <item> with sparkle:edSignature + length from sign_update
        4. Set sparkle:version to CFBundleVersion, sparkle:shortVersionString
           to MARKETING_VERSION, and link to the GitHub release page for
           the human-readable release notes
        5. Deploy the website (wrangler deploy) so the new entry goes live
      Sparkle reads the FIRST matching item whose version is newer than
      the installed version and presents that as the upgrade target.
    -->
